From 6024a509f1e389c5fa7ca16899643cb4ddadac93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:02:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wallpapers/image: add slideshow option to show only dynamic
 wallpapers

A slideshow mixing dynamic and single-image wallpapers showed the single
ones at any time of day, so a dark image could appear in daytime. Add an
option that makes the slideshow skip wallpapers without both variants.

BUG: 528401
